  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "\"Casa Mojo\" is located at 128 Walton Gulfview Drive, a quiet street. It is just 7 houses from the Beach with a private beach access and just a 5 minute bike ride to the beautiful Alys Beach community. <br><br>This home features 5 bedrooms and 4.5 baths with an amazing private pool. Every single thing in this home is well thought out and beautiful!<br><br>Enjoy a Beach vacation like no other in this beautiful private home!<br><br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 14):<br><br>FIRST LEVEL:<br>- Fully Equipped Kitchen with Stainless Steel Appliances <br>- Large Walk In Pantry<br>- Living and Dining Area<br>- Master Bedroom with King Bed, TV and Private Bath with glass enclosed shower<br>- Laundry Room with Full Size Washer/Dryer<br>- Half Bath<br>- Large Covered Front Porch with Comfortable Seating<br>- Large Screened Back Porch with Comfortable Seating/Dining Table and Outdoor Grilling Station (Gas Grill), TV<br><br>SECOND LEVEL:<br>- Bedroom with King Bed, TV and Private Bath, Access to Covered Porch<br>- Bedroom with King Bed, TV<br>- Bedroom with King Bed, TV<br>- Shared Bath located in Hallway<br>- Bunkroom with 6 Twin Beds, TV and Private Bath with Tub/Shower Combination, Access to Covered Porch<br>- Large Covered Porch with Comfortable Seating<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Private Pool (Heated for additional fee) - approximately 32' x 16' and 5' deep with a shallow area approx 6\" deep great for small kids.<br>- Lounge and Adirondack chairs on pool deck<br>- Outdoor Fire pit for use on cool evenings(not for cooking)<br>- Perfect location - Only minutes from the Beach Access<br>- Plenty of Outdoor Space and Seating<br>- Gas Grill<br>- Fenced Back Yard<br>- 2 Beach Wagons, 2 Umbrellas and 12 Beach Chairs provided for guest use<br>- 4 Adult Bikes Provided<br>- Pets considered (Must receive approval, please include breed and age of dog in your inquiry e-mail notes) <br><br>NEIGHBORHOOD HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Quiet Street perfect for families<br>- Private Beach Access<br>- 10 minute bike ride to the Alys Beach Community, shopping and restaurants<br>- There is no community pool - private pool only<br><br>** Guest responsible for providing beach and pool towels**<br><br><br>BOOKING POLICY:<br>• A 50% Advance Deposit is due at the time of booking.<br>• Balance is due 30 days prior to arrival date.<br>• Deposits are fully refundable if cancellations are given 30 days prior to arrival date.<br>• Check-In begins at 4:00PM CST. If available, an early check-in may be requested for an additional fee.<br>• Check-Out is by 10:00AM CST. If available, a late check-out may be requested for an additional fee.<br>• Must Be 25 Or Older To Rent. We have a strict family only policy. No exceptions.<br><br>The home is pet friendly for APPROVED pets only for a (non-refundable) Additional Fee:<br> - Small or Medium sized dogs ONLY<br> - Non-Shedding <br> - House-Trained<br> - Maximum of 2 Dogs<br><br><br>Call, text or email for more information or to book this beautiful property.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
